	(text "Input board (custom-pdm). 8 on/off inputs + 1 analog 0-5 V.\nPer input: 4.7k series, BAT54S clamp, 10 nF; 10k pull-up (SW1) and 10k pull-down (SW2) on the wire side.\nBoth DIP OFF = MCU weak pull (firmware). Generated by tools/gen_input_board_sch.py - edit the script, not this file."
